@ops = http://localhost:4004/operations
@cargo = http://localhost:4004/cargo
@vc2 = d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@vc1 = d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@vc3 = d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003

### 1) VC-2026-0002 (PLANNED) arrives → ARRIVED, ata = now
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc2}})/OperationsService.arrive
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Should FAIL 409: startWork from ARRIVED (must berth first)
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc2}})/OperationsService.startWork
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3) Berth → BERTHED, and its B01 allocation becomes isConfirmed = true
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc2}})/OperationsService.berth
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4) Check the confirmed allocation
GET {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc2}})?$select=callNumber,status_code,ata&$expand=berthAllocations($select=isConfirmed)

### 5) Should FAIL 400: change the status directly
PATCH {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc2}})
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status_code": "DEPARTED" }

### 6) Should SUCCEED: same status sent along with a real change (what Fiori does)
PATCH {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc2}})
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status_code": "BERTHED", "remarks": "Pilot on board 05:40" }

### 7) VC-2026-0001 (WORKING) completes
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc1}})/OperationsService.complete
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8) Should FAIL 400: departure before its arrival (ata = 11 Nov 04:30)
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc1}})/OperationsService.depart
Content-Type: application/json

{ "atd": "2026-11-10T00:00:00Z" }

### 9) Departs now → DEPARTED
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc1}})/OperationsService.depart
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10) Should FAIL 400: cancel without a reason
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc3}})/OperationsService.cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11) Cancel VC-2026-0003 with a reason → CANCELLED, B03 becomes free
POST {{ops}}/VesselCalls({{vc3}})/OperationsService.cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Charterer changed discharge port" }

### 12) Paint declaration (ASSESSED, duty 176400 unpaid): clear should FAIL 409
POST {{cargo}}/CustomsDeclarations(31000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/CargoService.clear
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13) Pay the duty → DUTY_PAID
POST {{cargo}}/CustomsDeclarations(31000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/CargoService.payDuty
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 14) Clear → CLEARED + container OCLU1002001 released from HOLD (see the sap-messages response header)
POST {{cargo}}/CustomsDeclarations(31000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/CargoService.clear
Content-Type: application/json

{ "remarks": "MSDS received and verified" }

### 15) The paint container is back in the yard
GET {{cargo}}/Containers(21000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003)?$select=containerNumber,status_code

### 16) Should FAIL 409: file an already CLEARED shipping bill
POST {{cargo}}/CustomsDeclarations(31000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003)/CargoService.file
Content-Type: application/json

{}